(5448695, 784429, 102811, '<td valign="top">Its very seldom that I would award a 1 so as I am about to I thought it polite to explain. Broadly speaking, in this challenge I would award a 4 simply for entering something with a person or animal in it, an extra 1 or 2 for it being obvioulsy candid (by my interpretation)  1 or 2 for technical merit (Composition, exposure etc) and then 1 or 2 for the wow factor or creativity. Looking at your picture and starting at the 4 I immediately have to remove 1 for the fact that Kitty is starring straight at you (not candid IMO), 1 for the strange colour cast (tungsten) and at least 1 for the date stamp being left on the picture. As that only leaves 1 I can''t then deduct another 1 for the excessive noise or the soft focus.<br/> <br/>I hope that explains why I left you a 1 all of which is irrelevant if you were trying for the brown but if not I hope it is of some help for furture challenges.</td>', 'Its very seldom that I would award a 1 so as I am about to I thought it polite to explain. Broadly speaking, in this challenge I would award a 4 simply for entering something with a person or animal in it, an extra 1 or 2 for it being obvioulsy candid (by my interpretation)  1 or 2 for technical merit (Composition, exposure etc) and then 1 or 2 for the wow factor or creativity. Looking at your picture and starting at the 4 I immediately have to remove 1 for the fact that Kitty is starring straight at you (not candid IMO), 1 for the strange colour cast (tungsten) and at least 1 for the date stamp being left on the picture. As that only leaves 1 I can''t then deduct another 1 for the excessive noise or the soft focus. I hope that explains why I left you a 1 all of which is irrelevant if you were trying for the brown but if not I hope it is of some help for furture challenges.', '2009-04-22 14:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
