(5451071, 784241, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I would have preferred the composition to be not quite so central.</td>', 'Nice shot, I would have preferred the composition to be not quite so central.', '2009-04-24 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451073, 784353, 87252, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of a quiet moment in hat looks to be a loud festival or performance. Colourful, sharp and well composed, nice DOF too.</td>', 'Excellent capture of a quiet moment in hat looks to be a loud festival or performance. Colourful, sharp and well composed, nice DOF too.', '2009-04-24 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451074, 783974, 87252, '<td valign="top">Good moment, looks a bit posed so you''ll probably lose marks with DNMC fascists. I would have liked to see all of both his hand but that''s a nitpick.</td>', 'Good moment, looks a bit posed so you''ll probably lose marks with DNMC fascists. I would have liked to see all of both his hand but that''s a nitpick.', '2009-04-24 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451076, 784327, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, cool DOF, interesting setting. I feel that although this is clearly a candid mooment you''re going to lose marks because the expression isn''t universally appealing.</td>', 'Nice composition, cool DOF, interesting setting. I feel that although this is clearly a candid mooment you''re going to lose marks because the expression isn''t universally appealing.', '2009-04-24 15:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451078, 784013, 87252, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great situation, cute child, concerned looking adult, colourful balloons and an interesting background. I feel that the composition needs some work, it would have been nice to see he whole of the lady, perhaps including more of the background as well using a wider angle. I would also have liked to see this in pure black and white, it would lend an extra air of sorrow and calm to the situation which would contrast nicely with the balloons.</td>', 'This looks like a great situation, cute child, concerned looking adult, colourful balloons and an interesting background. I feel that the composition needs some work, it would have been nice to see he whole of the lady, perhaps including more of the background as well using a wider angle. I would also have liked to see this in pure black and white, it would lend an extra air of sorrow and calm to the situation which would contrast nicely with the balloons.', '2009-04-24 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451085, 784397, 87252, '<td valign="top">Warm expression and she is clearly off guard, but I''m not sure this counts as a candid as she is looking directly at the lens. I also feel this is a bit too much of a "snapshot" to merit a very high score - the lighting is too direct and harsh, the composition needs work, either taking this in a portrait orientation or placing her face to the left of the shot (using the rule of thirds). A shallower depth of field would also have benefited this shot.</td>', 'Warm expression and she is clearly off guard, but I''m not sure this counts as a candid as she is looking directly at the lens. I also feel this is a bit too much of a "snapshot" to merit a very high score - the lighting is too direct and harsh, the composition needs work, either taking this in a portrait orientation or placing her face to the left of the shot (using the rule of thirds). A shallower depth of field would also have benefited this shot.', '2009-04-24 15:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451086, 784417, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely shot, great bright colours, superb composition and DOF. One of my faves so far.</td>', 'Wow, lovely shot, great bright colours, superb composition and DOF. One of my faves so far.', '2009-04-24 15:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451092, 782953, 87252, '<td valign="top">Ha, very quirky! I like the reflection idea, one of the more original in this challenge. The shot has a lot of potential, I feel that if the wholeshot was shifted slightly left, i.e the whole of the pig was visible and the chair in the bottom right was gone and the whole thing straightened up a bit this would be classic. I''m obsessed with black and white but I fell that this in B/W would make it stand out from the competition a bit more.</td>', 'Ha, very quirky! I like the reflection idea, one of the more original in this challenge. The shot has a lot of potential, I feel that if the wholeshot was shifted slightly left, i.e the whole of the pig was visible and the chair in the bottom right was gone and the whole thing straightened up a bit this would be classic. I''m obsessed with black and white but I fell that this in B/W would make it stand out from the competition a bit more.', '2009-04-24 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451094, 784446, 87252, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, im sure she''s very happy with it, unfortunately I don''t think this has a very "candid" feel to it, even if it is. I''m pretty much ignoring the whole "what is candid?" debate here though so I''m throwing you a 7!</td>', 'Excellent portrait, im sure she''s very happy with it, unfortunately I don''t think this has a very "candid" feel to it, even if it is. I''m pretty much ignoring the whole "what is candid?" debate here though so I''m throwing you a 7!', '2009-04-24 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451095, 783140, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, I would have liked to see the whole of his arm though!</td>', 'Sweet shot, I would have liked to see the whole of his arm though!', '2009-04-24 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451097, 784444, 87252, '<td valign="top">This has a lovely feel to it, Everyone is positioned just right for the sun to really catch them nicely. Well done.</td>', 'This has a lovely feel to it, Everyone is positioned just right for the sun to really catch them nicely. Well done.', '2009-04-24 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451098, 782936, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think it''s slghtly over sharpened though, this might have been an attempt to correct the fact that the focus isn''t really on the boy. I''d recommend either a deeper depth of field or making sure the subject is fully in focus!</td>', 'Nice shot, I think it''s slghtly over sharpened though, this might have been an attempt to correct the fact that the focus isn''t really on the boy. I''d recommend either a deeper depth of field or making sure the subject is fully in focus!', '2009-04-24 15:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451099, 783642, 87252, '<td valign="top">He looks awesome, sweet guitar too! This shot seems slightly dark on my screen.</td>', 'He looks awesome, sweet guitar too! This shot seems slightly dark on my screen.', '2009-04-24 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451101, 783164, 92907, '<td valign="top">very interesting tone...yet it really fits with the scene.  well done</td>', 'very interesting tone...yet it really fits with the scene.  well done', '2009-04-24 15:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451102, 784235, 87252, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I really dig this type of shot, I''m sure it''ll do well in this challenge!</td>', 'Lovely shot, I really dig this type of shot, I''m sure it''ll do well in this challenge!', '2009-04-24 15:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451103, 784347, 92907, '<td valign="top">great dof...black and white tonal range is really good. love the expression on his face.</td>', 'great dof...black and white tonal range is really good. love the expression on his face.', '2009-04-24 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451104, 784223, 87252, '<td valign="top">Ha! I''d love to know what the joke was. Would have been good to see all of both of his hands.</td>', 'Ha! I''d love to know what the joke was. Would have been good to see all of both of his hands.', '2009-04-24 15:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451105, 784411, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2009-04-24 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451106, 784288, 92907, '<td valign="top">i can tell what you were trying to capture with shooting from the back..but somehow i would have loved to have seen the expression on her face.  however, really nice shot..great clarity and colour too.</td>', 'i can tell what you were trying to capture with shooting from the back..but somehow i would have loved to have seen the expression on her face.  however, really nice shot..great clarity and colour too.', '2009-04-24 15:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451108, 784261, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Great moment, lovely black and white conversion. I think this will do very well in this challenge, I hope to see it in the top 10!</td>', 'Wonderful! Great moment, lovely black and white conversion. I think this will do very well in this challenge, I hope to see it in the top 10!', '2009-04-24 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451110, 784331, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, great DOF, excellent use of (I think!) a window and a darkened room for lighting!</td>', 'Nice portrait, great DOF, excellent use of (I think!) a window and a darkened room for lighting!', '2009-04-24 15:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451113, 784057, 87252, '<td valign="top">Super shot, taking photos of police is illegal in the UK now so you''re privileged to still have public freedom!</td>', 'Super shot, taking photos of police is illegal in the UK now so you''re privileged to still have public freedom!', '2009-04-24 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451116, 784089, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2009-04-24 15:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451118, 783704, 87252, '<td valign="top">This seems quite "snapshoty" The composition needs some work and the lighting is quite harsh. Strangely it also seems quite dark on my screen!</td>', 'This seems quite "snapshoty" The composition needs some work and the lighting is quite harsh. Strangely it also seems quite dark on my screen!', '2009-04-24 15:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451119, 784158, 87252, '<td valign="top">Ha nice one! Would have been nice to see this one with a shallower DOF to throw the background out a bit more.</td>', 'Ha nice one! Would have been nice to see this one with a shallower DOF to throw the background out a bit more.', '2009-04-24 15:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451122, 784369, 87252, '<td valign="top">This is quite snapshoty, the composition need a bit of tweaking, the putting the boy''s face further up in the frame and getting the whole of the girl in the foreground''s face in would have been great (you should try never to chop chins off portraits, tops of heads and parts of foreheads are ok but not chins!). Also I think it would have been better if the girl in the foreground was in sharp focus, and the boy OOF!. Hope this was helpful.</td>', 'This is quite snapshoty, the composition need a bit of tweaking, the putting the boy''s face further up in the frame and getting the whole of the girl in the foreground''s face in would have been great (you should try never to chop chins off portraits, tops of heads and parts of foreheads are ok but not chins!). Also I think it would have been better if the girl in the foreground was in sharp focus, and the boy OOF!. Hope this was helpful.', '2009-04-24 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451124, 782472, 87252, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I think the subjects are too far away to make this a really attractive shot though.</td>', 'Good idea, I think the subjects are too far away to make this a really attractive shot though.', '2009-04-24 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451125, 784200, 87252, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. I''m not a big fan of the frame though, seems a bit over the top to me.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. I''m not a big fan of the frame though, seems a bit over the top to me.', '2009-04-24 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451126, 784276, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great expression and excellent composition of an interesting subject. I feel this would have benefited from a black and white conversion however, to really bring out the craggy details of his face.</td>', 'Great expression and excellent composition of an interesting subject. I feel this would have benefited from a black and white conversion however, to really bring out the craggy details of his face.', '2009-04-24 15:41:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5451128, 784010, 87252, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I like the angle. It would have been nice if there was a sharper focus on the eyes and not so much the hair. Also it''s a bit noisy - I don''t personally mind this at all I think it adds character, but noise it not DPC friendly (fascists!). I''d recommend a program like neat image or noise ninja to run over shots like this before entering for challenges, it''ll bring your score up by at least half a point!</td>', 'Lovely shot, I like the angle. It would have been nice if there was a sharper focus on the eyes and not so much the hair. Also it''s a bit noisy - I don''t personally mind this at all I think it adds character, but noise it not DPC friendly (fascists!). I''d recommend a program like neat image or noise ninja to run over shots like this before entering for challenges, it''ll bring your score up by at least half a point!', '2009-04-24 15:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451129, 784432, 87252, '<td valign="top">What a great subject!</td>', 'What a great subject!', '2009-04-24 15:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451131, 783084, 87252, '<td valign="top">Good idea and interesting subjects, would have been nice to see the whole of their feet though!</td>', 'Good idea and interesting subjects, would have been nice to see the whole of their feet though!', '2009-04-24 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451135, 784293, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I like the inversion of the subject/ foreground DOF, makes it more interesting than your average shot like this. I would have preferred this shot to have the couple in the top right third of the composition to remove some of the superfluous background detail and place more emphasis on the flower- foreground.</td>', 'Great idea, I like the inversion of the subject/ foreground DOF, makes it more interesting than your average shot like this. I would have preferred this shot to have the couple in the top right third of the composition to remove some of the superfluous background detail and place more emphasis on the flower- foreground.', '2009-04-24 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451136, 784301, 24980, '<td valign="top">My first impression was confusion, but this held my attention longer than any other image in the challenge. The longer I looked at it the more I liked it. I hope other feel the same way because it is ribbon material</td>', 'My first impression was confusion, but this held my attention longer than any other image in the challenge. The longer I looked at it the more I liked it. I hope other feel the same way because it is ribbon material', '2009-04-24 15:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451138, 784376, 87252, '<td valign="top">Awesome location, great great idea, lovely b/w conversion and the subjects are wonderfully placed. I do feel that the composition needs a bit of work here though - I would either have zoomed in a bit further or cropped the tree-detail out of the top of the shot.</td>', 'Awesome location, great great idea, lovely b/w conversion and the subjects are wonderfully placed. I do feel that the composition needs a bit of work here though - I would either have zoomed in a bit further or cropped the tree-detail out of the top of the shot.', '2009-04-24 15:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451139, 784449, 24980, '<td valign="top">that one eye make this a great image</td>', 'that one eye make this a great image', '2009-04-24 15:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451143, 784324, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, very atmospheric, the anonymity is superb and and yet her bodyshape and stillness suggests a deep concentration which i''m sure many ''togs can relate to. Fave from me!</td>', 'Sweet shot, very atmospheric, the anonymity is superb and and yet her bodyshape and stillness suggests a deep concentration which i''m sure many ''togs can relate to. Fave from me!', '2009-04-24 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451145, 783852, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sorry but there is no human subject, not a candid!</td>', 'Sorry but there is no human subject, not a candid!', '2009-04-24 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451146, 784368, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet, would have been great to see  the whole of the swatter though! Nice comp all round.</td>', 'Sweet, would have been great to see  the whole of the swatter though! Nice comp all round.', '2009-04-24 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451148, 782693, 87252, '<td valign="top">Awesome, great light, subject, composition and b/w converstion. A fave from me!</td>', 'Awesome, great light, subject, composition and b/w converstion. A fave from me!', '2009-04-24 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451149, 783851, 24980, '<td valign="top">The background make this image. I highlights the fact that he is oblivious to it all</td>', 'The background make this image. I highlights the fact that he is oblivious to it all', '2009-04-24 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451152, 782716, 24980, '<td valign="top">The highlighted hair on the girl and horse gives the impression of one-ness between horse and girl</td>', 'The highlighted hair on the girl and horse gives the impression of one-ness between horse and girl', '2009-04-24 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451154, 784324, 24980, '<td valign="top">Fantastic- the backlight makes the girl leap out at you 9</td>', 'Fantastic- the backlight makes the girl leap out at you 9', '2009-04-24 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451155, 784361, 24980, '<td valign="top">I keep comming back to this image and wondering what is he thinking</td>', 'I keep comming back to this image and wondering what is he thinking', '2009-04-24 16:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451156, 782893, 24980, '<td valign="top">nice composition the iceberg draws you in, the people give it scale and make the image tell a story</td>', 'nice composition the iceberg draws you in, the people give it scale and make the image tell a story', '2009-04-24 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451328, 783810, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice image and a good observation of the author''s surroundings - not quite a "candid" although it could be viewed that way. It''s very pleasant to look at. The sun is over done and blown out, but in some ways, that is a plus. The author might want to revisit this image at some point and tinker with the light bloom using available SFx to generate a different look and feel to the image. A worthy entry into challenge.</td>', 'A very nice image and a good observation of the author''s surroundings - not quite a "candid" although it could be viewed that way. It''s very pleasant to look at. The sun is over done and blown out, but in some ways, that is a plus. The author might want to revisit this image at some point and tinker with the light bloom using available SFx to generate a different look and feel to the image. A worthy entry into challenge.', '2009-04-24 19:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451332, 783164, 101256, '<td valign="top">An intriguing look into a rite of passage for Muslims and a location where non-Muslims are not allowed. Very interesting and for most unique. The image has an interesting monotone overlay with white being ever so slighting on the side of being over done which adds drama and interest to the image. A very effective demonstration of contrast control, this image is a technical success. Not quite an artistic success, it does do it''s job of portraying a holy rite. Well done.</td>', 'An intriguing look into a rite of passage for Muslims and a location where non-Muslims are not allowed. Very interesting and for most unique. The image has an interesting monotone overlay with white being ever so slighting on the side of being over done which adds drama and interest to the image. A very effective demonstration of contrast control, this image is a technical success. Not quite an artistic success, it does do it''s job of portraying a holy rite. Well done.', '2009-04-24 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451333, 784044, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and precise, this is an amazing image that has just one minor technical flaw - the light reflections in the eyes. This would have been much more effective if less light was used in composing the image or perhaps if the light were more indirect reducing the reflection. This minor technical issue affects the emotional impact of the image greatly and not in a positive way. If that had been properly controlled, this would have had great impact and been a very strong contender for a top prize - as it is, it will certainly be a top ten image.</td>', 'Very crisp and precise, this is an amazing image that has just one minor technical flaw - the light reflections in the eyes. This would have been much more effective if less light was used in composing the image or perhaps if the light were more indirect reducing the reflection. This minor technical issue affects the emotional impact of the image greatly and not in a positive way. If that had been properly controlled, this would have had great impact and been a very strong contender for a top prize - as it is, it will certainly be a top ten image.', '2009-04-24 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451345, 784301, 101256, '<td valign="top">An intriging title and effective image is very impressive - the author did well to capture a scene using the tools of reflectivel light. It is a very busy image which detracts somewhat from it''s immediate impact, but the over all technical success affects the artistic impact in a positive way. A very good entry into the challenge it should place high.</td>', 'An intriging title and effective image is very impressive - the author did well to capture a scene using the tools of reflectivel light. It is a very busy image which detracts somewhat from it''s immediate impact, but the over all technical success affects the artistic impact in a positive way. A very good entry into the challenge it should place high.', '2009-04-24 20:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451349, 784200, 101256, '<td valign="top">This very effective casual portrait exemplifies the nature of candid photography and capture the mood and introspection of the moment. A great capture illustrating a thoughtful moment. This should place very high in the competition. Well done.</td>', 'This very effective casual portrait exemplifies the nature of candid photography and capture the mood and introspection of the moment. A great capture illustrating a thoughtful moment. This should place very high in the competition. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451350, 782936, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus detracts from a very good look at a national event. While it''s significantly flawed technically (focus mostly), the candid artistic impact is positive and interesting. Well done.</td>', 'The soft focus detracts from a very good look at a national event. While it''s significantly flawed technically (focus mostly), the candid artistic impact is positive and interesting. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451354, 784009, 101256, '<td valign="top">The initial impression was that this was way to dark to be truly effective, but on comment review, the mood is directly related to the black and the very subtle white tones just compliment the over all effect. Crisp and sharp, the natural expression and body posture conveys a sense of good will and thus is very effective. Originally rated a 9, the image has been bumped to a 10 as this viewer feels this should properly be a top ten image if not a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'The initial impression was that this was way to dark to be truly effective, but on comment review, the mood is directly related to the black and the very subtle white tones just compliment the over all effect. Crisp and sharp, the natural expression and body posture conveys a sense of good will and thus is very effective. Originally rated a 9, the image has been bumped to a 10 as this viewer feels this should properly be a top ten image if not a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451355, 784232, 101256, '<td valign="top">Natural candid captures are very hard to pull off in particular from the angle the author chose. This is a very effective image and conversion - the author has a good sense for zone system images and demonstrates it here. On original rating review, this image was rated a 9, but on comment review, the technical and artistic excellance justifies rerating to a 10. A top ten image and potential ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Natural candid captures are very hard to pull off in particular from the angle the author chose. This is a very effective image and conversion - the author has a good sense for zone system images and demonstrates it here. On original rating review, this image was rated a 9, but on comment review, the technical and artistic excellance justifies rerating to a 10. A top ten image and potential ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451356, 783060, 101256, '<td valign="top">The overall grayscale approach to this was originally viewed as a negative and a rating of 9, but on comment review, this viewer has rethought the original reaction and rerated it to a 10.  While not quite to the standard set by other images in this challenge, it is a totally casual moment of tranquility and friendship between the subject and his dog. The angle is very good and impacts a sense of depth not normally seen in images of this tonal range. Both an artistic and technical success this should be a top twenty image if not a top ten. Well done.</td>', 'The overall grayscale approach to this was originally viewed as a negative and a rating of 9, but on comment review, this viewer has rethought the original reaction and rerated it to a 10.  While not quite to the standard set by other images in this challenge, it is a totally casual moment of tranquility and friendship between the subject and his dog. The angle is very good and impacts a sense of depth not normally seen in images of this tonal range. Both an artistic and technical success this should be a top twenty image if not a top ten. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451359, 783104, 101256, '<td valign="top">The contrasting scale of the little one and the steps during a candid moment is a great capture. One issue with this image keeping it from being rated as a 10 is that the image is overally tall - it might have been better to crop the top steps off to the top at the second steps to help focus on the child. As it is, it''s a very effective image and worth every point of a nine. A potential top ten, this is most certainly a top fifteen image and depending on other raters, maybe a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'The contrasting scale of the little one and the steps during a candid moment is a great capture. One issue with this image keeping it from being rated as a 10 is that the image is overally tall - it might have been better to crop the top steps off to the top at the second steps to help focus on the child. As it is, it''s a very effective image and worth every point of a nine. A potential top ten, this is most certainly a top fifteen image and depending on other raters, maybe a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451367, 783849, 101256, '<td valign="top">Unforced imagery is always a plus and this appears to be very natural and unforced. It might have been better to get a little tighter in on the subject and eliminate a large portion of the wall, but it works as is. The focus seems a little softer than it should be which may be a by-product of the black and white conversion or maybe decompression from RAW. It''s not immediately noticable though so that''s a plus. A very good candid portrait and certainly a top twenty image if not a top ten. Well done.</td>', 'Unforced imagery is always a plus and this appears to be very natural and unforced. It might have been better to get a little tighter in on the subject and eliminate a large portion of the wall, but it works as is. The focus seems a little softer than it should be which may be a by-product of the black and white conversion or maybe decompression from RAW. It''s not immediately noticable though so that''s a plus. A very good candid portrait and certainly a top twenty image if not a top ten. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451374, 784448, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp, a very casual and candid moment is perfectly captured. The conversion is perfect and the intricate details are very impressive. On first pass review, this viewer thought there was a flaw in the image, but on comment review, that was a incorrect impression allowing for a rerating to a 10. This could very well be a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp, a very casual and candid moment is perfectly captured. The conversion is perfect and the intricate details are very impressive. On first pass review, this viewer thought there was a flaw in the image, but on comment review, that was a incorrect impression allowing for a rerating to a 10. This could very well be a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-24 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451381, 784199, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very fresh and different image in this challenge, the subject caught in a very candid moment - one can imagine the stories being told and the effect on a inviduals life. A terrific image and very good spur of the moment capture.</td>', 'A very fresh and different image in this challenge, the subject caught in a very candid moment - one can imagine the stories being told and the effect on a inviduals life. A terrific image and very good spur of the moment capture.', '2009-04-24 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451383, 784042, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very natural image evoking earlier and simpler times. The image is crisp and sharp and the excellant conversion makes it technically perfect. It is also artistically impressive, but falls just short of having a totally positive effect. Having said that, it should place very well, if not a ribbon contender.</td>', 'A very natural image evoking earlier and simpler times. The image is crisp and sharp and the excellant conversion makes it technically perfect. It is also artistically impressive, but falls just short of having a totally positive effect. Having said that, it should place very well, if not a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-24 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451385, 783104, 103534, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones</td>', 'beautiful tones', '2009-04-24 20:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451389, 784368, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very candid image that appears posed, but isn''t - the natural and unforced smile indicating a sense of fun and mischief is a very positive effect. Unfortunately, a great candid capture is every so slightly over exposed leading to an unnatural washed out appearance. The image also seems slightly under focused. Still a good effort and with a little more time, would have been a 10. Well done.</td>', 'A very candid image that appears posed, but isn''t - the natural and unforced smile indicating a sense of fun and mischief is a very positive effect. Unfortunately, a great candid capture is every so slightly over exposed leading to an unnatural washed out appearance. The image also seems slightly under focused. Still a good effort and with a little more time, would have been a 10. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451397, 784261, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple and very elegant, there is nothing more to be said. One of the best images in this challenge without a doubt. Originally, this viewer thought it was slightly over exposed giving it a nine, but on review, this view was clearly in error and is rerated a 10. A complete technical and artistic success. Very well done candid - this should, by rights, by a blue ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple and very elegant, there is nothing more to be said. One of the best images in this challenge without a doubt. Originally, this viewer thought it was slightly over exposed giving it a nine, but on review, this view was clearly in error and is rerated a 10. A complete technical and artistic success. Very well done candid - this should, by rights, by a blue ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451404, 784158, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp, a candid moment between two friends demonstrates the very nature of candid. A completel technical success, the natural stance and appearance of the subjects is an artistic plus. While the image appears to be slightly over sharpened, it isn''t. It might have helped to reframe the image slightly to one side of the other, but it works just fine as it is. Well done.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp, a candid moment between two friends demonstrates the very nature of candid. A completel technical success, the natural stance and appearance of the subjects is an artistic plus. While the image appears to be slightly over sharpened, it isn''t. It might have helped to reframe the image slightly to one side of the other, but it works just fine as it is. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451407, 783827, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, there is a very slight issue with the highlight at the tip of the nose being over done which detracts from the image technically. This image may have been more effective is there was some less vague background which would balance the offset subject. Overall a good effort and one worthy of a top fifteen finish and possibly a top ten. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and elegant, there is a very slight issue with the highlight at the tip of the nose being over done which detracts from the image technically. This image may have been more effective is there was some less vague background which would balance the offset subject. Overall a good effort and one worthy of a top fifteen finish and possibly a top ten. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-24 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451408, 782970, 101256, '<td valign="top">The natural appearance of this image, even with it''s minor technical issues makes it a beautiful candid moment betwee mother and child. The natural, unforced appearance of the two subjects demonstrates the nature of a candid image. An added plus is the reflection in the door which compliments the posture and pose of the subjects in every way. The image could have done with a crop on the right to enhance the reflective effect and in this viewer''s opinion, placed it well within the top five if not a ribbon contender. As it is, it should place within the top ten - well done.</td>', 'The natural appearance of this image, even with it''s minor technical issues makes it a beautiful candid moment betwee mother and child. The natural, unforced appearance of the two subjects demonstrates the nature of a candid image. An added plus is the reflection in the door which compliments the posture and pose of the subjects in every way. The image could have done with a crop on the right to enhance the reflective effect and in this viewer''s opinion, placed it well within the top five if not a ribbon contender. As it is, it should place within the top ten - well done.', '2009-04-24 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451411, 784077, 101256, '<td valign="top">Originally scored a nine for a perceived technical flaw, this flaw is not present on comment review and thus is rerated to a ten.  The incredible detail enhances the over all impact and the subject''s concentration on something outside the frame of the image increases the interest in the subject and how he is reacting to external influences. This is a excellant effort on the part of the author and is a demonstration of how to properly capture a purely candid moment in the life of a child. By rights it should place withint the top five and should be a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Originally scored a nine for a perceived technical flaw, this flaw is not present on comment review and thus is rerated to a ten.  The incredible detail enhances the over all impact and the subject''s concentration on something outside the frame of the image increases the interest in the subject and how he is reacting to external influences. This is a excellant effort on the part of the author and is a demonstration of how to properly capture a purely candid moment in the life of a child. By rights it should place withint the top five and should be a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451413, 783391, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image that on first pass failed to over whelmingly impress, but on comment review, the image is simple outstanding. A pure, simple and elegant candid moment perfectly framed and captured. A complete technical and artistic success, one cannot sufficiently express the pleasure of viewing this excellant composition. While the competition for top honors is probably going to be stiff, this should place well within the top five and is a sure blue ribbon contender. Rerated from a 9 to a 10. Well done.</td>', 'Another image that on first pass failed to over whelmingly impress, but on comment review, the image is simple outstanding. A pure, simple and elegant candid moment perfectly framed and captured. A complete technical and artistic success, one cannot sufficiently express the pleasure of viewing this excellant composition. While the competition for top honors is probably going to be stiff, this should place well within the top five and is a sure blue ribbon contender. Rerated from a 9 to a 10. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451418, 782630, 101256, '<td valign="top">A private moment that somehow feels completely natural and unforced. While a little too distant with a completely uninteresting foreground and background, this is technically competant and falls just short of being an artistic success. While it may have been impossible, a little closer in, or a different DOF to decrease the background detail would have been a huge plus. As this may have been impossible to achieve, this image suffices to convery the author''s intent. Well done.</td>', 'A private moment that somehow feels completely natural and unforced. While a little too distant with a completely uninteresting foreground and background, this is technically competant and falls just short of being an artistic success. While it may have been impossible, a little closer in, or a different DOF to decrease the background detail would have been a huge plus. As this may have been impossible to achieve, this image suffices to convery the author''s intent. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451424, 784334, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and monotone treatment is a plus for this image from an artistic standpoint. The models are positioned perfectly and their reactions unforced and completely natural - it''s almost a commercial quality advertising image. The slight crop on the left cutting short the natural curve of the model''s elbow is a negative and is immediately noticable. Even with this minor issue, this image is a technical and artistic success. Not quite a top ten image, it certainly could be considered a top twenty and if luck holds, a top fifteen. Well done.</td>', 'The soft focus and monotone treatment is a plus for this image from an artistic standpoint. The models are positioned perfectly and their reactions unforced and completely natural - it''s almost a commercial quality advertising image. The slight crop on the left cutting short the natural curve of the model''s elbow is a negative and is immediately noticable. Even with this minor issue, this image is a technical and artistic success. Not quite a top ten image, it certainly could be considered a top twenty and if luck holds, a top fifteen. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451433, 784347, 101256, '<td valign="top">The grizzled veteran cop is always a suitable subject for candid photography and this borders on being the perfect piece of photo journalism. The sense of concentration and "seen it all" visage is a homage to police officers who toil every day to protect and serve from the mundane traffic duty to preventing serious crime, this is an outstanding effort on the part of the author to portray an uncommon sympathetic view of law enforcement officers. One minor issue might be a little better crop on the left, but it certainly is very effective as it is. An excellant conversion only compliments the overall capture. Well done.</td>', 'The grizzled veteran cop is always a suitable subject for candid photography and this borders on being the perfect piece of photo journalism. The sense of concentration and "seen it all" visage is a homage to police officers who toil every day to protect and serve from the mundane traffic duty to preventing serious crime, this is an outstanding effort on the part of the author to portray an uncommon sympathetic view of law enforcement officers. One minor issue might be a little better crop on the left, but it certainly is very effective as it is. An excellant conversion only compliments the overall capture. Well done.', '2009-04-24 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451435, 783851, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s best not to say anything at all when confronted with the perfect image perfectly executed. This is an amazing candid look at an every day act in an everyday setting. Wonderful. Well done. If it were up to this viewer, it would be a ribbon winner for sure.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s best not to say anything at all when confronted with the perfect image perfectly executed. This is an amazing candid look at an every day act in an everyday setting. Wonderful. Well done. If it were up to this viewer, it would be a ribbon winner for sure.', '2009-04-24 21:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451463, 784449, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant character portrait sligtly affected by over done white on the hat brim. However, it created an interesting feature with the light highlights on the shade portion of the face. A terrific artistic success and a qualified technical success, this image should place high in the competition as a candid portrayal of what appears to be a colorful character. A terrific conversion to black and white compliments the composition. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant character portrait sligtly affected by over done white on the hat brim. However, it created an interesting feature with the light highlights on the shade portion of the face. A terrific artistic success and a qualified technical success, this image should place high in the competition as a candid portrayal of what appears to be a colorful character. A terrific conversion to black and white compliments the composition. Well done.', '2009-04-24 22:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451466, 784295, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, an elegant candid portrait perfectly framed. There are two ways to view the rather soft focus in that while a sharper image would have been very effective, this softer approach is also a good choice and does not detract from the image in an artistic sense. A very good look at a candid moment which should place well in the competition.</td>', 'Simple and effective, an elegant candid portrait perfectly framed. There are two ways to view the rather soft focus in that while a sharper image would have been very effective, this softer approach is also a good choice and does not detract from the image in an artistic sense. A very good look at a candid moment which should place well in the competition.', '2009-04-24 22:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451467, 784333, 101256, '<td valign="top">A complete artistic success, this image is negatively affected by being over sharpened which is immediately noticable in particular around the edges of the subject and the subject''s hat. This only increases the rather flat colors of the subject. A little more time taken while composing would have only benefitted this image positively. While there are some very noticable technical flaws, the artistic impression over comes these flaws in a very effective presentation. Well done.</td>', 'A complete artistic success, this image is negatively affected by being over sharpened which is immediately noticable in particular around the edges of the subject and the subject''s hat. This only increases the rather flat colors of the subject. A little more time taken while composing would have only benefitted this image positively. While there are some very noticable technical flaws, the artistic impression over comes these flaws in a very effective presentation. Well done.', '2009-04-24 22:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451469, 783567, 101256, '<td valign="top">Laugh out loud moments are always appreciated and the perfect capture of the playful child peeking through the handles is highly amusing and very effective - it''s a pleasure to view a child acting in an uninhibited way. Technically competant with pleasing colors and crisp, sharp details only enhance an already effective composition. Well done.</td>', 'Laugh out loud moments are always appreciated and the perfect capture of the playful child peeking through the handles is highly amusing and very effective - it''s a pleasure to view a child acting in an uninhibited way. Technically competant with pleasing colors and crisp, sharp details only enhance an already effective composition. Well done.', '2009-04-24 22:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451470, 783084, 101256, '<td valign="top">A powerful and compelling composition - a sound and dynamic image in the best tradition of photo journalism. A candid image like this should tell a story and this image certainly does that. During the first run through for rating, this viewer thought it had a minor technical flaw, but on comment review, this was a mistaken impression. Rerated to a 10, this image should place high in the competition if not a ribbon winner. An excellant photo.</td>', 'A powerful and compelling composition - a sound and dynamic image in the best tradition of photo journalism. A candid image like this should tell a story and this image certainly does that. During the first run through for rating, this viewer thought it had a minor technical flaw, but on comment review, this was a mistaken impression. Rerated to a 10, this image should place high in the competition if not a ribbon winner. An excellant photo.', '2009-04-24 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451473, 784307, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple is only another way to describe perfection and this elegant and compelling image of older folks obviously, both lovers and friends, walking into the darker walkway is unbelievably impressive.  The author has captured a moment in time that all of us face eventually and this pair is doing so with complete faith in each other. Originally rated an eight, upon review, this was a mistake on the part of the reviewer and has been rerated a 10 for it''s unbelievable romantic, technical and artistic impact. An incredible effort on the part of the author and it would be a complete injustice if this didn''t win the blue ribbon. Very well done and a personal favorite.</td>', 'Simple is only another way to describe perfection and this elegant and compelling image of older folks obviously, both lovers and friends, walking into the darker walkway is unbelievably impressive.  The author has captured a moment in time that all of us face eventually and this pair is doing so with complete faith in each other. Originally rated an eight, upon review, this was a mistake on the part of the reviewer and has been rerated a 10 for it''s unbelievable romantic, technical and artistic impact. An incredible effort on the part of the author and it would be a complete injustice if this didn''t win the blue ribbon. Very well done and a personal favorite.', '2009-04-24 22:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451478, 784322, 101256, '<td valign="top">A candid action portrait that is purposeful and intense, the image just seems to lack the artistic impact needed to elevate it to the level of the other images in this incredibly exceptional competition. From a technical standpoint, this is well done with a vaguely detailed background complimenting the crisp sharp imagery of the subject. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks "something" to give it the necessary pop and wow factor. Perhaps it''s a little too precise in particular with capturing the ball in mid air - it might have been better to add a little motion blue or perhaps crop the balls out all together. The author might want to experiment with it a little, maybe bringing it out to black and white or grayscale which might help. A worthy and solid entry into the challenge, it falls just sort of being outstanding.</td>', 'A candid action portrait that is purposeful and intense, the image just seems to lack the artistic impact needed to elevate it to the level of the other images in this incredibly exceptional competition. From a technical standpoint, this is well done with a vaguely detailed background complimenting the crisp sharp imagery of the subject. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks "something" to give it the necessary pop and wow factor. Perhaps it''s a little too precise in particular with capturing the ball in mid air - it might have been better to add a little motion blue or perhaps crop the balls out all together. The author might want to experiment with it a little, maybe bringing it out to black and white or grayscale which might help. A worthy and solid entry into the challenge, it falls just sort of being outstanding.', '2009-04-24 22:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451482, 783730, 101256, '<td valign="top">A pure candid moment effectively captured, rich in detail with a very convincing sense of depth and dimension. Originally, this reviewer had a less than positive reaction to the image while making the ratings pass as it seemed to be less of an effort than some of the more spectacular candid images submitted in this challenge and it was rated at an eight. After initiating the comment review, this reviewer was clearly mistaken in that impression and thus has rerated the image to a nine. The slight technical issues with the direct back lighting effect creating odd highlights on the left hand subject''s face and the "halo" effect that led to an initial impression of over sharpening are not sufficiently negative as was first assumed. From an artistic standpoint, this could very well be an advertising image. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A pure candid moment effectively captured, rich in detail with a very convincing sense of depth and dimension. Originally, this reviewer had a less than positive reaction to the image while making the ratings pass as it seemed to be less of an effort than some of the more spectacular candid images submitted in this challenge and it was rated at an eight. After initiating the comment review, this reviewer was clearly mistaken in that impression and thus has rerated the image to a nine. The slight technical issues with the direct back lighting effect creating odd highlights on the left hand subject''s face and the "halo" effect that led to an initial impression of over sharpening are not sufficiently negative as was first assumed. From an artistic standpoint, this could very well be an advertising image. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-24 22:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451487, 783817, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sound and solid entry into the challenge, this is technically a great image - crisp and sharp with nothing over done or over whelming. The slightly flat conversion is a negative and it could do with a little more contrast to really make it pop and give it some wow factor. Having said that, from the standpoint of the challenge subject, it is very effective, but not overly artistic again lacking pop and wow factor. It is a good illustration of a candid moment though - it''s a very hard image to rate properly, but this viewer thinks that with the technical and artistic combination it is a solid eight and if there were a way to make it an 8.5, that would be a better ratings choice. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A sound and solid entry into the challenge, this is technically a great image - crisp and sharp with nothing over done or over whelming. The slightly flat conversion is a negative and it could do with a little more contrast to really make it pop and give it some wow factor. Having said that, from the standpoint of the challenge subject, it is very effective, but not overly artistic again lacking pop and wow factor. It is a good illustration of a candid moment though - it''s a very hard image to rate properly, but this viewer thinks that with the technical and artistic combination it is a solid eight and if there were a way to make it an 8.5, that would be a better ratings choice. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-24 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451492, 782869, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sound and solid entry into the challenge a conceptual standpoint, this is technically a flawed image with the flat background and shooting into the light which creates too much of a contrast dynamic. The image it could do with a little more contrast to really make it pop and give it some wow factor which would have been accomplished by taking a different angle or waiting for a little better lighting situation. Another choice would have been to use a fill flash to increase the details in the darker areas. Having said that, from the standpoint of the challenge subject, it is very effective, but not overly artistic again lacking pop and wow factor. It is a good illustration of a candid moment though.  A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A sound and solid entry into the challenge a conceptual standpoint, this is technically a flawed image with the flat background and shooting into the light which creates too much of a contrast dynamic. The image it could do with a little more contrast to really make it pop and give it some wow factor which would have been accomplished by taking a different angle or waiting for a little better lighting situation. Another choice would have been to use a fill flash to increase the details in the darker areas. Having said that, from the standpoint of the challenge subject, it is very effective, but not overly artistic again lacking pop and wow factor. It is a good illustration of a candid moment though.  A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-24 23:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451497, 783122, 101256, '<td valign="top">Children are sometimes considered by "artistic dilettantes" to be the easiest subject in the world to capture, but that''s not true - it has to be the righ moment in the right setting to be truly convincing. There are times when the simple things fascinate our little ones and they become more than casual observers of their world - this image captures that interest perfectly with an excellant composition. Originally, this reviewer voted this an eight because of a perceived technical issue, but on review, this viewer was clearly mistaken and will rerate it a 10. It is near perfect technically with vaguely detailed background and crisp sharp focus - the color combinations are excellant and effective. From an artistic stanpoint, it is a cut above the average submission in this challenge with top ten potential. Well done.</td>', 'Children are sometimes considered by "artistic dilettantes" to be the easiest subject in the world to capture, but that''s not true - it has to be the righ moment in the right setting to be truly convincing. There are times when the simple things fascinate our little ones and they become more than casual observers of their world - this image captures that interest perfectly with an excellant composition. Originally, this reviewer voted this an eight because of a perceived technical issue, but on review, this viewer was clearly mistaken and will rerate it a 10. It is near perfect technically with vaguely detailed background and crisp sharp focus - the color combinations are excellant and effective. From an artistic stanpoint, it is a cut above the average submission in this challenge with top ten potential. Well done.', '2009-04-24 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451500, 784241, 101256, '<td valign="top">A splendid capture of what can clearly be seen as a character piece, this image doesn''t suffer any technical issues that are immediately noticable. From an artistic standpoint, the author might have wanted to use a little closer focus to enhance the natural friendly features of the subject and the right detail of her clothes and basket. Just on the edge of being a complete technical and artistic success. A solid entry into the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'A splendid capture of what can clearly be seen as a character piece, this image doesn''t suffer any technical issues that are immediately noticable. From an artistic standpoint, the author might have wanted to use a little closer focus to enhance the natural friendly features of the subject and the right detail of her clothes and basket. Just on the edge of being a complete technical and artistic success. A solid entry into the challenge. Well done.', '2009-04-24 23:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
