(5451529, 784261, 86447, '<td valign="top">an adorable 8</td>', 'an adorable 8', '2009-04-24 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451530, 784354, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid piece of photo journalism, this image is effective at presenting the subject with sensitivity. Rich detail and the intense visage compliment the vaguely detailed background. While this is a unqualified technical success, from an artistic standpoint, the color detracts from the subject''s emotional impact and it might have been more effective as a black and white or grayscale - the color just seems too bright and positive by comparision to the title. Having said that, it is effective and should rate high in the competition. Well done.</td>', 'A solid piece of photo journalism, this image is effective at presenting the subject with sensitivity. Rich detail and the intense visage compliment the vaguely detailed background. While this is a unqualified technical success, from an artistic standpoint, the color detracts from the subject''s emotional impact and it might have been more effective as a black and white or grayscale - the color just seems too bright and positive by comparision to the title. Having said that, it is effective and should rate high in the competition. Well done.', '2009-04-24 23:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451531, 783084, 92907, '<td valign="top">great candid shot!...really like it in black and white</td>', 'great candid shot!...really like it in black and white', '2009-04-24 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451532, 784308, 86447, '<td valign="top">The composition alone makes this a 7.   The whites make it an 8.</td>', 'The composition alone makes this a 7.   The whites make it an 8.', '2009-04-24 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451533, 784431, 86447, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful piece of history you''ve recorded so well.  Back to bump you from 8 to 9.</td>', 'Such a wonderful piece of history you''ve recorded so well.  Back to bump you from 8 to 9.', '2009-04-24 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451534, 784089, 86447, '<td valign="top">This would also work well in the "Lighting" challenge currently, too.   An 8 from me... would be a nine if there weren''t a bit of blown stuff.   <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'This would also work well in the "Lighting" challenge currently, too.   An 8 from me... would be a nine if there weren''t a bit of blown stuff.    Well done.', '2009-04-24 23:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451535, 784343, 86447, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  I''m not sure about the woman''s naked body and the innocent child in the same scene... but it''s well photographed.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  I''m not sure about the woman''s naked body and the innocent child in the same scene... but it''s well photographed.', '2009-04-24 23:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451538, 784075, 92907, '<td valign="top">what a sweet shot...fantastic capture</td>', 'what a sweet shot...fantastic capture', '2009-04-24 23:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451541, 784086, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the little things are overlooked that make a major impact on an image that should be a winner. While the darks are highly detailed and well controlled, the whites are just slightly out of control on the left which is distracting when the image is viewed as a whole. When the individual pieces of the image are taken into account, the subject is extremely well lit and captured rich in detail and properly presented. The background, while properly vague, is too vague and could use some more definition to give the impression of depth and dimension as it appears to be flat which detracts from the foreground detail. There are quite a few technical issues with this image (like the washed out chess pieces) in the reviewers opinon. However, once again, the incredible subject with the rich detail and sense of purpose overcome the technical problems and make this a worthy entry into the challenge - perhaps even a top fifteen entry.</td>', 'Sometimes the little things are overlooked that make a major impact on an image that should be a winner. While the darks are highly detailed and well controlled, the whites are just slightly out of control on the left which is distracting when the image is viewed as a whole. When the individual pieces of the image are taken into account, the subject is extremely well lit and captured rich in detail and properly presented. The background, while properly vague, is too vague and could use some more definition to give the impression of depth and dimension as it appears to be flat which detracts from the foreground detail. There are quite a few technical issues with this image (like the washed out chess pieces) in the reviewers opinon. However, once again, the incredible subject with the rich detail and sense of purpose overcome the technical problems and make this a worthy entry into the challenge - perhaps even a top fifteen entry.', '2009-04-24 23:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451545, 784200, 86447, '<td valign="top">An 8 from me... I like the whole of this.</td>', 'An 8 from me... I like the whole of this.', '2009-04-24 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451550, 784331, 101256, '<td valign="top">With proper focus on the entire face, this would have been a sure top ten image and one that would have been talked about - it very well could be an outstanding character candid and a perfect representation of what Grandmothers should be. Unfortunately, the DOF issue detracts from it''s artistic perfection and impression. Coulda, woulda, shoulda, a little more time and a DOF preview before capture would have elevated this to ribbon contention easily. Having said that, it''s still a worthy entry into the challenge and should place within the top twenty five.</td>', 'With proper focus on the entire face, this would have been a sure top ten image and one that would have been talked about - it very well could be an outstanding character candid and a perfect representation of what Grandmothers should be. Unfortunately, the DOF issue detracts from it''s artistic perfection and impression. Coulda, woulda, shoulda, a little more time and a DOF preview before capture would have elevated this to ribbon contention easily. Having said that, it''s still a worthy entry into the challenge and should place within the top twenty five.', '2009-04-24 23:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451553, 784074, 101256, '<td valign="top">While making the initial ratings pass through the images for this challenge, this was rated an 8 because it failed to positively impact this reviewer. Upon comment review, this reviewer was clearly mistaken - this is a complete artistic success and while the subject focus is a little softer than the foreground would suggest, technically it is competant and well composed - a nice moment in time seen and captured in good fasion. Originally rated an eight, it has been rerated a nine - it should place high in the challenge and potentially a ribbon winner.</td>', 'While making the initial ratings pass through the images for this challenge, this was rated an 8 because it failed to positively impact this reviewer. Upon comment review, this reviewer was clearly mistaken - this is a complete artistic success and while the subject focus is a little softer than the foreground would suggest, technically it is competant and well composed - a nice moment in time seen and captured in good fasion. Originally rated an eight, it has been rerated a nine - it should place high in the challenge and potentially a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-24 23:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451569, 784010, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great candid but the title was unnecessary. In fact, it takes away what would have been a good sense of mystery...</td>', 'Great candid but the title was unnecessary. In fact, it takes away what would have been a good sense of mystery...', '2009-04-25 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
