(5451761, 783060, 67152, '<td valign="top">the perspective is unique - more from the dog rather than the human - but i think without the man''s face it loses a bit of something - it is so close!</td>', 'the perspective is unique - more from the dog rather than the human - but i think without the man''s face it loses a bit of something - it is so close!', '2009-04-25 09:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
