(5451951, 784010, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like how the light really shines in her hair - but the noise levels in the face costs the image a bit</td>', 'i like how the light really shines in her hair - but the noise levels in the face costs the image a bit', '2009-04-25 14:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451991, 784213, 94855, '<td valign="top">I like the candid but not so much the way it was edited but that is just me personally problem not the norm!</td>', 'I like the candid but not so much the way it was edited but that is just me personally problem not the norm!', '2009-04-25 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5451995, 784220, 94855, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2009-04-25 15:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452072, 783898, 101256, '<td valign="top">About as candid as an image can get, it suffers from soft focus which is a negative. This is probably an auto focus issue as the camera picked up the outside left as the area focus rather than spot focus on the subject. It would have been difficult in any case becaues of the odd lighting to get a good spot focus, so manual would have been a better choice. From an artistic standpoint, it falls just short of being truly interesting and compelling. It is, however, a good candid image and worthy of the challenge.</td>', 'About as candid as an image can get, it suffers from soft focus which is a negative. This is probably an auto focus issue as the camera picked up the outside left as the area focus rather than spot focus on the subject. It would have been difficult in any case becaues of the odd lighting to get a good spot focus, so manual would have been a better choice. From an artistic standpoint, it falls just short of being truly interesting and compelling. It is, however, a good candid image and worthy of the challenge.', '2009-04-25 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452074, 782961, 101256, '<td valign="top">About as candid as an image can get, it suffers from something that is undefinable. The expressions on the members of the horse patrol are good, but this could have been a little more effective by changing the angle and concentrating on one or two members of the patrol. From a technical standpoint, it is properly focused and just a little darker than it should be. Given the difficult lighting situation, the author did well to make it as colorful as it is. From an artistic standpoint, it just doesn''t seem to be compelling. It is, however, a good candid image and worthy of the challenge.</td>', 'About as candid as an image can get, it suffers from something that is undefinable. The expressions on the members of the horse patrol are good, but this could have been a little more effective by changing the angle and concentrating on one or two members of the patrol. From a technical standpoint, it is properly focused and just a little darker than it should be. Given the difficult lighting situation, the author did well to make it as colorful as it is. From an artistic standpoint, it just doesn''t seem to be compelling. It is, however, a good candid image and worthy of the challenge.', '2009-04-25 19:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452077, 783526, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid candid portrait, but it lacks some context. There is something happening that needs to be revealed, but isn''t. From a technical standpoint, it is competant, properly lighted and colors and backgrond controlled. From an artistic standpoint - frankly it has no context and thus, lacks impact. - no pop or wow factor. A good entry into the challenge, the author might have taken more time to include some activity and interest into the image.</td>', 'A good solid candid portrait, but it lacks some context. There is something happening that needs to be revealed, but isn''t. From a technical standpoint, it is competant, properly lighted and colors and backgrond controlled. From an artistic standpoint - frankly it has no context and thus, lacks impact. - no pop or wow factor. A good entry into the challenge, the author might have taken more time to include some activity and interest into the image.', '2009-04-25 19:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452081, 784361, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those problematic images that reviewers don''t like to see. Not because it''s a technical mess or an artistic failure - in fact, exactly the opposite. In this case, the detailess white shoulder/blanket distracts from the image of Mom and Child which, frankly are stellar both in composition, mood and impact. The author handled all the other technical and artistic issues perfectly with that one single exception which negatively impacts the entire image. Still a worthy entry into the competition, if a little more time had been taken with the exposure, or patience waiting for a change in lighting, this would have been a sure ribbon contender.</td>', 'This is one of those problematic images that reviewers don''t like to see. Not because it''s a technical mess or an artistic failure - in fact, exactly the opposite. In this case, the detailess white shoulder/blanket distracts from the image of Mom and Child which, frankly are stellar both in composition, mood and impact. The author handled all the other technical and artistic issues perfectly with that one single exception which negatively impacts the entire image. Still a worthy entry into the competition, if a little more time had been taken with the exposure, or patience waiting for a change in lighting, this would have been a sure ribbon contender.', '2009-04-25 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452102, 784324, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and impressive in an artistic sense if only because of the nature of the subject. The image needs to be viewed more than once to properly evaluate the dark and the details that lurk within - not an image that takes kindly to casual viewing. While not to the general taste, this is an amazing image in several respects. The dark photographer appears to be over sharpened but that may be artifact from the back lighting. A very impressive conversion, this was orignally rated an 8, but on review, has been rerated a 10 for it''s innovative approach to the subject challenge in addition to it''s technical and artistic success.  While it might not place high, any reviewer who has been involved in photography more than a few years will recognise the technique used here to express an idea which was more than expertly executed. Well done.</td>', 'Dramatic and impressive in an artistic sense if only because of the nature of the subject. The image needs to be viewed more than once to properly evaluate the dark and the details that lurk within - not an image that takes kindly to casual viewing. While not to the general taste, this is an amazing image in several respects. The dark photographer appears to be over sharpened but that may be artifact from the back lighting. A very impressive conversion, this was orignally rated an 8, but on review, has been rerated a 10 for it''s innovative approach to the subject challenge in addition to it''s technical and artistic success.  While it might not place high, any reviewer who has been involved in photography more than a few years will recognise the technique used here to express an idea which was more than expertly executed. Well done.', '2009-04-25 20:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452104, 784430, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant casual portrait from an artistic viewpoint, it suffers from being a little too far in terms of subject and has been over sharpened which may be an example of RAW to .jpeg conversion sharpening as this reviewer doesn''t believe that the over sharpening was intentional. The soft focus could be due to a camera meter selection - area vs spot focus on automatic. A good entry into the challenge, it certainly demonstrates a candid moment effectively, it''s technical issues keep it from placing higher.</td>', 'An excellant casual portrait from an artistic viewpoint, it suffers from being a little too far in terms of subject and has been over sharpened which may be an example of RAW to .jpeg conversion sharpening as this reviewer doesn''t believe that the over sharpening was intentional. The soft focus could be due to a camera meter selection - area vs spot focus on automatic. A good entry into the challenge, it certainly demonstrates a candid moment effectively, it''s technical issues keep it from placing higher.', '2009-04-25 20:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452106, 784399, 101256, '<td valign="top">From an artistic standpoint, this is an image that suffers from too much background - it would have been a better choice to crop the top out of the image to concentrate on the subject. This can be illustrated by moving the browser side slider control so that the image is topped just at the first line on the background door. An excellant conversion technically, it captured the nature of a candid moment perfectly and was a good demonstration of how a photographer has to be ready to capture the moment. A worthy entry into the challene, it''s technical excellance is affected by it''s slightly off artistic construction.</td>', 'From an artistic standpoint, this is an image that suffers from too much background - it would have been a better choice to crop the top out of the image to concentrate on the subject. This can be illustrated by moving the browser side slider control so that the image is topped just at the first line on the background door. An excellant conversion technically, it captured the nature of a candid moment perfectly and was a good demonstration of how a photographer has to be ready to capture the moment. A worthy entry into the challene, it''s technical excellance is affected by it''s slightly off artistic construction.', '2009-04-25 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452108, 784298, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good candid moment that suffers from unfortunate lighting conditions and a difficult background. The rather odd lighting on the background affects the subject negatively because of the background - the subject appears to be over lighted and thus washed out. While it does meet the challenge criteria as a candid moment, it lacks technical and artistic impact. The author might have done better to get closer into the subject and at a sharper angle to the left.</td>', 'A good candid moment that suffers from unfortunate lighting conditions and a difficult background. The rather odd lighting on the background affects the subject negatively because of the background - the subject appears to be over lighted and thus washed out. While it does meet the challenge criteria as a candid moment, it lacks technical and artistic impact. The author might have done better to get closer into the subject and at a sharper angle to the left.', '2009-04-25 20:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452109, 784301, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like the overall effect and exposure.  Windows offer some great visual stories especially in urban settings.  (But the exaggerated frame adds absolutely nothing to this shot.)</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like the overall effect and exposure.  Windows offer some great visual stories especially in urban settings.  (But the exaggerated frame adds absolutely nothing to this shot.)', '2009-04-25 20:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452111, 784328, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much reliance on black in this image affects it from both a technical and artistic standpoint. The ultimate black and bright whites, while an interesting artistic choice, are jarring and ineffective creating an unnatural look to the subject''s face - almost clown like this may not have been the author''s intent. The conversion is a good one - it just doesn''t work in this setting. A better choice may have been grayscale to increase it''s viewability and impact from both a technical and artistic sense. A candid moment that is worthy of entry into the challenge, it falls short of being outstanding.</td>', 'Too much reliance on black in this image affects it from both a technical and artistic standpoint. The ultimate black and bright whites, while an interesting artistic choice, are jarring and ineffective creating an unnatural look to the subject''s face - almost clown like this may not have been the author''s intent. The conversion is a good one - it just doesn''t work in this setting. A better choice may have been grayscale to increase it''s viewability and impact from both a technical and artistic sense. A candid moment that is worthy of entry into the challenge, it falls short of being outstanding.', '2009-04-25 20:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452113, 783939, 101256, '<td valign="top">While a candid moment, the image is much too small to be truly effective - there is nothing to recommend the image from a technical or artistic standpoint - it lacks any impact or context other than eating oranges. The author might have done better to include more background or perhaps the attendant activity to give the impact some pop and context.</td>', 'While a candid moment, the image is much too small to be truly effective - there is nothing to recommend the image from a technical or artistic standpoint - it lacks any impact or context other than eating oranges. The author might have done better to include more background or perhaps the attendant activity to give the impact some pop and context.', '2009-04-25 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452114, 783086, 101256, '<td valign="top">While a candid moment there is nothing to recommend the image from a technical or artistic standpoint - it lacks any impact or context other than being a snapsoht of a cat. The author might have done better to include more background or perhaps activity to give the impact some pop and context.</td>', 'While a candid moment there is nothing to recommend the image from a technical or artistic standpoint - it lacks any impact or context other than being a snapsoht of a cat. The author might have done better to include more background or perhaps activity to give the impact some pop and context.', '2009-04-25 20:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452115, 784067, 101256, '<td valign="top">A child being a child is always a good choice for a candid moment as children are easy subjects. In this case, the candid moment is a very good capture in terms of action and "the moment". Every technical issue appears to be well controlled. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks impact meaning that it has more interest as a very good snapshot rather than a thoughtful portrait. Having said that, this reviewer on third review, believes that the very nature of candid means being of the moment and this image is of the moment - thus a rerate from a 7 to an 8. A good solid entry into the challenge and a view into an everyday moment.</td>', 'A child being a child is always a good choice for a candid moment as children are easy subjects. In this case, the candid moment is a very good capture in terms of action and "the moment". Every technical issue appears to be well controlled. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks impact meaning that it has more interest as a very good snapshot rather than a thoughtful portrait. Having said that, this reviewer on third review, believes that the very nature of candid means being of the moment and this image is of the moment - thus a rerate from a 7 to an 8. A good solid entry into the challenge and a view into an everyday moment.', '2009-04-25 20:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452119, 783393, 101256, '<td valign="top">Originally, this reviewer saw this as just another candid moment presented in snapshot format. On review, it''s clear that this is much more than average and is a perfect moment in a child''s life. All technical aspects are well controlled and the simple act of the child holding the stick appearing to direct the ball to do something is terrific. Additionally, the child is visually appealing. Originally a 7, this is being rerated as an 8. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Originally, this reviewer saw this as just another candid moment presented in snapshot format. On review, it''s clear that this is much more than average and is a perfect moment in a child''s life. All technical aspects are well controlled and the simple act of the child holding the stick appearing to direct the ball to do something is terrific. Additionally, the child is visually appealing. Originally a 7, this is being rerated as an 8. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 20:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452121, 784276, 101256, '<td valign="top">A farmer''s face well framed and captured. Unfortunately, the sense of "moment" is missing from this image because it lacks context. From a technical standpoint, it''s perfect - everything from the saturation just approaching being over the edge, to the excellant complexion of the subject and the little details of character, it''s exceptional. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks any context or frame of reference to make this a truly "candid" image. In any other challenge where portrature is a component, this might have worked, but it falls just short of being truly candid.</td>', 'A farmer''s face well framed and captured. Unfortunately, the sense of "moment" is missing from this image because it lacks context. From a technical standpoint, it''s perfect - everything from the saturation just approaching being over the edge, to the excellant complexion of the subject and the little details of character, it''s exceptional. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks any context or frame of reference to make this a truly "candid" image. In any other challenge where portrature is a component, this might have worked, but it falls just short of being truly candid.', '2009-04-25 20:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452124, 784179, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is full of humor and a sense of fun. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions - the author might have wanted to use a little more saturation to correct for the washed out effect. The use of the vaguely detailed background is a plus. From an artistic standpoint, the subject is too offset to the right to be truly effective - a little more towards the center would have been a huge plus. Still a worthy entry into the challenge, it just falls short of being outstanding.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is full of humor and a sense of fun. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions - the author might have wanted to use a little more saturation to correct for the washed out effect. The use of the vaguely detailed background is a plus. From an artistic standpoint, the subject is too offset to the right to be truly effective - a little more towards the center would have been a huge plus. Still a worthy entry into the challenge, it just falls short of being outstanding.', '2009-04-25 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452130, 783082, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions - the author might have wanted to use a little more saturation to correct for the washed out effect which is only enhanced by the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions - the author might have wanted to use a little more saturation to correct for the washed out effect which is only enhanced by the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452131, 783597, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge. Part of the artistic issue is that the details of the task are lost - a little closer look at the background subject may have been more appropriate.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge. Part of the artistic issue is that the details of the task are lost - a little closer look at the background subject may have been more appropriate.', '2009-04-25 21:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452134, 784342, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technically competant image and an excellent conversion with a clever observation for a title, this image suffers from a little too much space to be truly effective. It might have helped a little to crop the image to the edge of the bench on the left to make a little more concentrated and presented with a little more impact. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A technically competant image and an excellent conversion with a clever observation for a title, this image suffers from a little too much space to be truly effective. It might have helped a little to crop the image to the edge of the bench on the left to make a little more concentrated and presented with a little more impact. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452135, 783893, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on a task. Technically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452139, 783156, 101256, '<td valign="top">It might have been better to concentrate on the subjects in the foreground rather than the entire image which is too tall to be truly effective. A good conversion to black and white, the overall contrast is a little flat to be termed excellant. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'It might have been better to concentrate on the subjects in the foreground rather than the entire image which is too tall to be truly effective. A good conversion to black and white, the overall contrast is a little flat to be termed excellant. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452140, 783522, 101256, '<td valign="top">While obviously a "candid" moment, images of this type are hard to review if only because it''s unclear where it meets the challenge subject criteria or not. In this case, it''s better to error on the side of caution. A very expressive pair, these terrific apes are shown to be almost human in their demeanor. Originally scored a 7, this is rerated to an 8. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'While obviously a "candid" moment, images of this type are hard to review if only because it''s unclear where it meets the challenge subject criteria or not. In this case, it''s better to error on the side of caution. A very expressive pair, these terrific apes are shown to be almost human in their demeanor. Originally scored a 7, this is rerated to an 8. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452141, 784220, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is on the page. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus and pale features of the subject. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is on the page. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus and pale features of the subject. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452142, 783847, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is down the road. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is down the road. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.', '2009-04-25 21:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452143, 784013, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is down the road. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what ever is down the road. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to the rather soft focus. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-25 21:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452144, 784091, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is an image that is very hard to properly rate because of a major technical issue which is over sharpening. A more natural presentation without the sharpening issue would have made this a top ten as it''s a very natural and expressive candid moment. The image may not have needed any sharpening boost either to the edges or the subject. A good entry into the challenge unfortunately affected by a technical issue.</td>', 'This is an image that is very hard to properly rate because of a major technical issue which is over sharpening. A more natural presentation without the sharpening issue would have made this a top ten as it''s a very natural and expressive candid moment. The image may not have needed any sharpening boost either to the edges or the subject. A good entry into the challenge unfortunately affected by a technical issue.', '2009-04-25 21:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452147, 783969, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on placing the ear plugs. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on placing the ear plugs. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.', '2009-04-25 21:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452148, 782716, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderfully backlit scene - very touching image and I love how we can see the horses facial expression but we can feel the girls</td>', 'wonderfully backlit scene - very touching image and I love how we can see the horses facial expression but we can feel the girls', '2009-04-25 21:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452149, 782472, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what is happening in the background. A clever look through the lens of the glasses. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting except for the use of the glasses lens. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on what is happening in the background. A clever look through the lens of the glasses. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting except for the use of the glasses lens. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.', '2009-04-25 21:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452150, 784279, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent candid of a cute little guy - i think the sepia is a bit heavy handed here - but it is a really solid image.</td>', 'excellent candid of a cute little guy - i think the sepia is a bit heavy handed here - but it is a really solid image.', '2009-04-25 21:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452152, 784384, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on play which is a child''s natural state. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on play which is a child''s natural state. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting. A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.', '2009-04-25 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452153, 784190, 101256, '<td valign="top">The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on some activity. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting - a good suggestion would have been to add a little saturation to the image. It might also have helped to use a .2 neutral density filter in these lighting conditions to give the image some more color and "pop". A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.</td>', 'The sense of "moment" is present in this image and the obvious character being captured is intent on some activity. Technically and artistically, it seems a little dull which may be the lighting conditions in addition to being, well frankly uninteresting - a good suggestion would have been to add a little saturation to the image. It might also have helped to use a .2 neutral density filter in these lighting conditions to give the image some more color and "pop". A good entry into the challenge just lacking that something special to make it stand out.', '2009-04-25 21:33:42.000000', NULL, 1);
