(5452208, 783852, 101256, '<td valign="top">An out of the box entry which, if a loose standard were used, could be considered a candid moment, but this reviewer has to take the view that a landscape doen''t quite fit the challenge. Having said that, it is a competant outdoor image and as such deserves some credit for being different but not terribly interesting. If the intent of the author was to garner the lowest score possible, this should win whatever prize is offered for that achievement.</td>', 'An out of the box entry which, if a loose standard were used, could be considered a candid moment, but this reviewer has to take the view that a landscape doen''t quite fit the challenge. Having said that, it is a competant outdoor image and as such deserves some credit for being different but not terribly interesting. If the intent of the author was to garner the lowest score possible, this should win whatever prize is offered for that achievement.', '2009-04-25 22:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
