(5452256, 784269, 101256, '<td valign="top">In the ratings pass, this reviewer was uncomfortable rating this image - there are several levels of impact here which change every time it''s viewed. After six views and a close inspection of the image, this reviewer has to rerate it from a 6 to a 9 because it has incredible impact - the juxtaposition of child and adult is creative and a great capture. The intensity on the face of the (assumed) police officer as compared to the open honest of the child is very effective. While not exactly a ribbon contender, this should place well in the challenge.</td>', 'In the ratings pass, this reviewer was uncomfortable rating this image - there are several levels of impact here which change every time it''s viewed. After six views and a close inspection of the image, this reviewer has to rerate it from a 6 to a 9 because it has incredible impact - the juxtaposition of child and adult is creative and a great capture. The intensity on the face of the (assumed) police officer as compared to the open honest of the child is very effective. While not exactly a ribbon contender, this should place well in the challenge.', '2009-04-25 23:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452258, 782926, 101256, '<td valign="top">In the ratings pass, this reviewer was uncomfortable rating this image - there are several levels of impact here which change every time it''s viewed. After six views and a close inspection of the image, this reviewer has to rerate it from a 6 to a 9 because it has the technical quality one looks for in a high rated image even if it isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint - it lacks that certain "something" that makes it standout. It''s still a cut above the highly rated images in this challenge. While not exactly a ribbon contender, this should place well in the challenge.</td>', 'In the ratings pass, this reviewer was uncomfortable rating this image - there are several levels of impact here which change every time it''s viewed. After six views and a close inspection of the image, this reviewer has to rerate it from a 6 to a 9 because it has the technical quality one looks for in a high rated image even if it isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint - it lacks that certain "something" that makes it standout. It''s still a cut above the highly rated images in this challenge. While not exactly a ribbon contender, this should place well in the challenge.', '2009-04-25 23:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
