(5452286, 784342, 76335, '<td valign="top">Now that''s just freakin'' excellent. (And that may be my first use of "freakin" to describe someone''s work.) The harsh contrast, the lines, the multiple things happening in the frame... Lots to look at and contemplate. Candid, yes, but so much more.</td>', 'Now that''s just freakin'' excellent. (And that may be my first use of "freakin" to describe someone''s work.) The harsh contrast, the lines, the multiple things happening in the frame... Lots to look at and contemplate. Candid, yes, but so much more.', '2009-04-26 00:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452288, 783082, 76335, '<td valign="top">An honest capture. Candid for sure, as it''s obvious you''re making the best use of existing lighting. No attempt was made to clean up or "pre-compose" the shot. The angle is great. Love it!</td>', 'An honest capture. Candid for sure, as it''s obvious you''re making the best use of existing lighting. No attempt was made to clean up or "pre-compose" the shot. The angle is great. Love it!', '2009-04-26 00:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452289, 783898, 76335, '<td valign="top">Candid, but not much of interest to look at or see.</td>', 'Candid, but not much of interest to look at or see.', '2009-04-26 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452292, 784209, 76335, '<td valign="top">Candid, but not very interesting. The saturation is a little over the top.</td>', 'Candid, but not very interesting. The saturation is a little over the top.', '2009-04-26 00:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5452293, 783410, 76335, '<td valign="top">Candid, but a little soft.</td>', 'Candid, but a little soft.', '2009-04-26 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
