(5452298, 783972, 76335, '<td valign="top">Even if he were facing us, this wouldn''t be very interesting. The title doesn''t help. It''s just a guy on the phone. Sure it''s candid, but candids are easy when you''re subject is distracted and facing the other way. Try a hip shot next time and get in close...</td>', 'Even if he were facing us, this wouldn''t be very interesting. The title doesn''t help. It''s just a guy on the phone. Sure it''s candid, but candids are easy when you''re subject is distracted and facing the other way. Try a hip shot next time and get in close...', '2009-04-26 00:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
