(5453203, 784015, 94855, '<td valign="top">nice candid butmaybe too busy</td>', 'nice candid butmaybe too busy', '2009-04-27 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453456, 783975, 66548, '<td valign="top">WoW! 10</td>', 'WoW! 10', '2009-04-27 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453457, 783966, 66548, '<td valign="top">Wow. its a beautiful moment and you captured it very well. 9</td>', 'Wow. its a beautiful moment and you captured it very well. 9', '2009-04-27 02:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453458, 783730, 66548, '<td valign="top">Wow, really nice. Love it 9</td>', 'Wow, really nice. Love it 9', '2009-04-27 02:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453459, 784057, 66548, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful photo Love it. 9</td>', 'Wow, beautiful photo Love it. 9', '2009-04-27 02:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453460, 784074, 66548, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful lighting 9</td>', 'Wow, wonderful lighting 9', '2009-04-27 02:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453466, 782716, 70484, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful!!!!!! 10</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful!!!!!! 10', '2009-04-27 03:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453492, 784232, 67258, '<td valign="top">A beautifully observed photograph.  The monotone conversion is spot on, and compliments the subject.</td>', 'A beautifully observed photograph.  The monotone conversion is spot on, and compliments the subject.', '2009-04-27 03:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453496, 783851, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully interesting photo.  The subject intrigues me - smartly dressed, with his kindly looking face, apparently completing a newspaper crossword, and somewhat strangely, with a tape measure hanging down inside his jacket.  The cornucopia of items suggest this is a second-hand store - so much to look at.  A photo to return to again and again.</td>', 'What a wonderfully interesting photo.  The subject intrigues me - smartly dressed, with his kindly looking face, apparently completing a newspaper crossword, and somewhat strangely, with a tape measure hanging down inside his jacket.  The cornucopia of items suggest this is a second-hand store - so much to look at.  A photo to return to again and again.', '2009-04-27 04:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453498, 784301, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is just so much here, yet it all holds together.  Excellent work.</td>', 'There is just so much here, yet it all holds together.  Excellent work.', '2009-04-27 04:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453502, 784308, 67258, '<td valign="top">That is a mannequin, isn''t it? Rather bizarre!</td>', 'That is a mannequin, isn''t it? Rather bizarre!', '2009-04-27 04:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453504, 784269, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well spotted!</td>', 'Well spotted!', '2009-04-27 04:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453637, 784384, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment - I think this could have benefited from a slightly faster shutter speed though, the boy''s face is ever so slightly blurred. I also find the background to be slightly busy.</td>', 'Sweet moment - I think this could have benefited from a slightly faster shutter speed though, the boy''s face is ever so slightly blurred. I also find the background to be slightly busy.', '2009-04-27 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453638, 784307, 87252, '<td valign="top">Lovely evocative, emotional shot. The composition is great, although I would have liked the road to tail off to the dead centre of the shot, just nitpicking.</td>', 'Lovely evocative, emotional shot. The composition is great, although I would have liked the road to tail off to the dead centre of the shot, just nitpicking.', '2009-04-27 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453639, 784009, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice patch of light, good capture.</td>', 'Nice patch of light, good capture.', '2009-04-27 09:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453641, 784075, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet, good perspective.</td>', 'Sweet, good perspective.', '2009-04-27 09:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453642, 784367, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice comp through the chair legs, really frames the face nicely.</td>', 'Nice comp through the chair legs, really frames the face nicely.', '2009-04-27 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453648, 782630, 87252, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the different layers of texture here. Composition wise, I think this could be improved by shooting more perpendicular to the bench.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the different layers of texture here. Composition wise, I think this could be improved by shooting more perpendicular to the bench.', '2009-04-27 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453653, 784044, 87252, '<td valign="top">Although it may not necessarily be the case that this is posed, it does certainly give the impression of not being 100% candid. The shot is great, lovely expression and the reflections in the eyes are nice, but the white background won''t help your score here. I''m voting with benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Although it may not necessarily be the case that this is posed, it does certainly give the impression of not being 100% candid. The shot is great, lovely expression and the reflections in the eyes are nice, but the white background won''t help your score here. I''m voting with benefit of the doubt.', '2009-04-27 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453654, 783164, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow, great cultural scene.</td>', 'Wow, great cultural scene.', '2009-04-27 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453658, 784322, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh and DOF, I''d have liked to see both of the subject''s hands though.</td>', 'Great bokeh and DOF, I''d have liked to see both of the subject''s hands though.', '2009-04-27 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453659, 783156, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great shot, a departure from the standard DPC.</td>', 'Great shot, a departure from the standard DPC.', '2009-04-27 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453661, 783730, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow lovely setting, reminds me of Richmond in the UK overlooking the Thames. Great moment.</td>', 'Wow lovely setting, reminds me of Richmond in the UK overlooking the Thames. Great moment.', '2009-04-27 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453663, 783972, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great spot and nice composition.</td>', 'Great spot and nice composition.', '2009-04-27 09:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453959, 784417, 100831, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and color!!</td>', 'very nice composition and color!!', '2009-04-27 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453967, 783104, 100831, '<td valign="top">this is just fabulous... the textures, colors, and that adorable little girl</td>', 'this is just fabulous... the textures, colors, and that adorable little girl', '2009-04-27 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453978, 784010, 105783, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this picture is nostalgic and memorable</td>', 'The simplicity of this picture is nostalgic and memorable', '2009-04-27 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454016, 784109, 83544, '<td valign="top">Diferent from the other photos but I''m not sure how much I like it, maybe the unique idea, yes, but I still can see anywhere a candit</td>', 'Diferent from the other photos but I''m not sure how much I like it, maybe the unique idea, yes, but I still can see anywhere a candit', '2009-04-27 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454017, 784329, 83544, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo was a bit larger</td>', 'I wish this photo was a bit larger', '2009-04-27 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454031, 784429, 83544, '<td valign="top">I guess u are a starter in photography considering the quality of the photo, I just want to encourage you too keep what you are doing, the idea of the photo can save the quality, and your idea is great, just try next time to remove the date in your menu of the digital camera, you can be disqualified for that...I guess u have been given a low score till now from the photographers with fency cameras that doesn''t apriciate an idea, so that''s why I''m giving u a 10...keep shooting :)</td>', 'I guess u are a starter in photography considering the quality of the photo, I just want to encourage you too keep what you are doing, the idea of the photo can save the quality, and your idea is great, just try next time to remove the date in your menu of the digital camera, you can be disqualified for that...I guess u have been given a low score till now from the photographers with fency cameras that doesn''t apriciate an idea, so that''s why I''m giving u a 10...keep shooting :)', '2009-04-27 14:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454035, 782770, 105852, '<td valign="top">I think I might rate this higher if it were in another category.  But I don''t consider this to be in the candid category.</td>', 'I think I might rate this higher if it were in another category.  But I don''t consider this to be in the candid category.', '2009-04-27 14:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454061, 782770, 104378, '<td valign="top">some people never fail to amaze me on how flowers "fit" into every challenge...<br/> <br/>this is so candid I threw up on my monitor</td>', 'some people never fail to amaze me on how flowers "fit" into every challenge... this is so candid I threw up on my monitor', '2009-04-27 14:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
