(5456809, 784293, 106138, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who commented on this photo.  It happened that I had taken this photo the same week of the challenge, so I thought I''d see where I ended up by submitting it.  I think a couple folks didn''t make the connection that I reversed the DOF on purpose :--)  JimiRose, you got the point of this, and thanks again to everyone for their comments!  I''ll look forward to being an active participant in the community!<br/> <br/>GG</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who commented on this photo.  It happened that I had taken this photo the same week of the challenge, so I thought I''d see where I ended up by submitting it.  I think a couple folks didn''t make the connection that I reversed the DOF on purpose :--)  JimiRose, you got the point of this, and thanks again to everyone for their comments!  I''ll look forward to being an active participant in the community! GG', '2009-04-29 06:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
