(5457013, 784214, 57229, '<td valign="top">This is just a beautiful picture, plus or minus nothing. The selective desat does no harm at all and the sepia is just great. Firing off mad bursts and running sounds like a technique to me :)<br/>Bit sneaky you getting a better Posthumous ribbon than me, but there are forces over which we may have no control.</td>', 'This is just a beautiful picture, plus or minus nothing. The selective desat does no harm at all and the sepia is just great. Firing off mad bursts and running sounds like a technique to me :)Bit sneaky you getting a better Posthumous ribbon than me, but there are forces over which we may have no control.', '2009-04-29 09:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
