(5457026, 784342, 57229, '<td valign="top">Så det er i Norge! Derfor fikk du samme lys som meg - trodde kanskje dette var Deb i Tyskland...<br/> <br/>Love the various things happening and frozen time. Also the spaces between with dream-like effect of dead space in sharp light.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your Posthumous recognition.</td>', 'Så det er i Norge! Derfor fikk du samme lys som meg - trodde kanskje dette var Deb i Tyskland... Love the various things happening and frozen time. Also the spaces between with dream-like effect of dead space in sharp light. Congratulations on your Posthumous recognition.', '2009-04-29 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457028, 783796, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great candid.  Obviously neither was aware of what you were doing and this certainly doesn''t looked staged.  I love the girl''s sleepy face.  I miss that kind of thing.  Great shot!</td>', 'I thought this was a great candid.  Obviously neither was aware of what you were doing and this certainly doesn''t looked staged.  I love the girl''s sleepy face.  I miss that kind of thing.  Great shot!', '2009-04-29 09:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457042, 782869, 67697, '<td valign="top">The thing that caught my eye was what I presume to be a tower in the center of the circle.  At quick glance I thought it was a cross.  I like the whole composition - one of your geometric arrangements again - and also that there''s a glow around the reader.</td>', 'The thing that caught my eye was what I presume to be a tower in the center of the circle.  At quick glance I thought it was a cross.  I like the whole composition - one of your geometric arrangements again - and also that there''s a glow around the reader.', '2009-04-29 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457049, 784444, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like this image, a nicely seen and captured slice of life. Also like the processing very much.</td>', 'I like this image, a nicely seen and captured slice of life. Also like the processing very much.', '2009-04-29 09:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457053, 782716, 71167, '<td valign="top">WOOT! Congratulations Kim!!!!! Love this shot,a poignant moment, beautiful light, well processed and she looks too old! Put a book on her head or something! LOL, Great capture!</td>', 'WOOT! Congratulations Kim!!!!! Love this shot,a poignant moment, beautiful light, well processed and she looks too old! Put a book on her head or something! LOL, Great capture!', '2009-04-29 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457056, 784301, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad this did well.  I thought it was an amazing capture of stories.  Such a beautiful collage!  Congrats on your new PB!</td>', 'I''m so glad this did well.  I thought it was an amazing capture of stories.  Such a beautiful collage!  Congrats on your new PB!', '2009-04-29 09:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457061, 782953, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know, when I vote, I don''t often look at titles - so I will tell ya that I never saw that pig!  lol What a catch.  What I liked about the photo tho was that your candid was captured as a reflection.  I think for this challenge I would like to have seen the focus be more on that instead of opening up the pic including the pig.  But the pig IS a nice touch because how often does one see that?  lol</td>', 'You know, when I vote, I don''t often look at titles - so I will tell ya that I never saw that pig!  lol What a catch.  What I liked about the photo tho was that your candid was captured as a reflection.  I think for this challenge I would like to have seen the focus be more on that instead of opening up the pic including the pig.  But the pig IS a nice touch because how often does one see that?  lol', '2009-04-29 09:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457063, 784384, 36470, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very fun shot.  I gave it an 8.  Very underrated, IMO.</td>', 'I thought this was a very fun shot.  I gave it an 8.  Very underrated, IMO.', '2009-04-29 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457065, 783231, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was cool.  I liked how an everyday kind of guy was sitting in a brightly decorated kind of setting.  And it had some awkwardness to it, with him sitting in an odd position - like he was out of balance with the artwork on the wall.  Interesting find.</td>', 'I thought this was cool.  I liked how an everyday kind of guy was sitting in a brightly decorated kind of setting.  And it had some awkwardness to it, with him sitting in an odd position - like he was out of balance with the artwork on the wall.  Interesting find.', '2009-04-29 10:01:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457081, 782716, 61222, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a special moment in time. Congrats on your first ribbon. Love the lighting!!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a special moment in time. Congrats on your first ribbon. Love the lighting!!', '2009-04-29 10:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457084, 784015, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMO, this is a nicely composed shot, but it needs to be larger.  The rules allow you to submit a photo that is 640 pixels on it''s largest side -- yours is 444 pixels max.  <br/> <br/>Also, I think it could stand a tweak in contrast and brightness.  I don''t know if you have access to Photoshop, but working with curves is simple and effective.  I don''t know if they  have curves in Photoshop Elements, but if you don''t have curves, try an adjustment in brightness (a little darker) and contrast (a  little more).<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'IMO, this is a nicely composed shot, but it needs to be larger.  The rules allow you to submit a photo that is 640 pixels on it''s largest side -- yours is 444 pixels max.   Also, I think it could stand a tweak in contrast and brightness.  I don''t know if you have access to Photoshop, but working with curves is simple and effective.  I don''t know if they  have curves in Photoshop Elements, but if you don''t have curves, try an adjustment in brightness (a little darker) and contrast (a  little more). Good luck.', '2009-04-29 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457102, 784074, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  It truly is a natural spotlight.  Congrats on 12th place!</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  It truly is a natural spotlight.  Congrats on 12th place!', '2009-04-29 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457114, 784449, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice going, Lev.  This is truly a wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Nice going, Lev.  This is truly a wonderful portrait.', '2009-04-29 10:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457139, 783796, 39218, '<td valign="top">What I loved the most about this picture is that it could have been taken last week or fifty years ago.  The timlessness of this makes it that much more precious.  Love the B&amp;W and square crop too.  Really a wonderful capture.</td>', 'What I loved the most about this picture is that it could have been taken last week or fifty years ago.  The timlessness of this makes it that much more precious.  Love the B&W and square crop too.  Really a wonderful capture.', '2009-04-29 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457160, 784261, 39218, '<td valign="top">This couldn''t be more precious... LOVE it!  Great story!</td>', 'This couldn''t be more precious... LOVE it!  Great story!', '2009-04-29 11:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457172, 784214, 39218, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous and I would have thought it would have placed MUCH higher.  This needs to be printed and hung on a prominent wall in your home.  Congratulations on a great photograph.</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous and I would have thought it would have placed MUCH higher.  This needs to be printed and hung on a prominent wall in your home.  Congratulations on a great photograph.', '2009-04-29 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457195, 784449, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m so proud of the voters.  There was a time, when they wouldn''t have cared that the photo itself was so powerful that it totally compensates for an understandable technical imperfection -- especially on a candid!  I''m so encouraged to see the wisdom in overlooking what you apologized for in the hat rim and awarding this a very deserving first place!  Congratulations!</td>', 'I''m so proud of the voters.  There was a time, when they wouldn''t have cared that the photo itself was so powerful that it totally compensates for an understandable technical imperfection -- especially on a candid!  I''m so encouraged to see the wisdom in overlooking what you apologized for in the hat rim and awarding this a very deserving first place!  Congratulations!', '2009-04-29 11:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457196, 784417, 106138, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, fill-the-frame shot.  Great colors and very natural.  I assume your subject didn''t realize she was being photographed!  Nice DOF as well!</td>', 'This is a wonderful, fill-the-frame shot.  Great colors and very natural.  I assume your subject didn''t realize she was being photographed!  Nice DOF as well!', '2009-04-29 11:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457197, 784117, 24454, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid!  Congratulations on 2nd place!</td>', 'Excellent candid!  Congratulations on 2nd place!', '2009-04-29 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5457202, 782716, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I LOOOOOVE this photo!  That beautiful backlighting makes this so enchanting and magical.  I am so happy you won a ribbon with this photo.  Congratulations!!</td>', 'Oh, I LOOOOOVE this photo!  That beautiful backlighting makes this so enchanting and magical.  I am so happy you won a ribbon with this photo.  Congratulations!!', '2009-04-29 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
