(5459638, 784343, 15832, '<td valign="top">Dude.. That is so cute and theconnection between the baby and the pregnant painting (that i guess is the mother) is so nice... but you should know now that here on dpc simplicity and the picturistic Wow factor is the only thing you are gonna get a good vote on ;)   good eye friend... keep it on and i hope you are not letting this site have affect on you... It is only a very nice page to check out majority thinking on your art. thats why i have this love/hate connection to this site ;)   gets you on the ground if you whant to...   here you can see my work friend https://www.getdropbox.com/gallery/118765/1/Myndir?h=6ebe2e   not all dpc friendly but that is our work to find out isnt it ;)  Go for it!!!! and hope i see you soon<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-30 20:44:00.</i></td>', 'Dude.. That is so cute and theconnection between the baby and the pregnant painting (that i guess is the mother) is so nice... but you should know now that here on dpc simplicity and the picturistic Wow factor is the only thing you are gonna get a good vote on ;)   good eye friend... keep it on and i hope you are not letting this site have affect on you... It is only a very nice page to check out majority thinking on your art. thats why i have this love/hate connection to this site ;)   gets you on the ground if you whant to...   here you can see my work friend https://www.getdropbox.com/gallery/118765/1/Myndir?h=6ebe2e   not all dpc friendly but that is our work to find out isnt it ;)  Go for it!!!! and hope i see you soon', '2009-04-30 21:43:07.000000', '2009-04-30 21:44:00.000000', 0),
