(5466617, 784117, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I forget to look carefully at the Front Page.  This time I finally got around to it and found this gem.  Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes I forget to look carefully at the Front Page.  This time I finally got around to it and found this gem.  Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467043, 784255, 89220, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by booboo_goon:</b></div><hr/><i> Are you SERIOUS??? This was my top pick from the bunch, I think there is so much to look at in this pic. The peculiar way he''s holding on to the bike is very interesting, my eyes also stops by to take a peak inside the yellow box behind him. To top it off his facial expression is one that you could never capture in a posed photograph!!<br/> <br/>Love the colours and the crop of the shot too =) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanx booboo_goon for ur wonderful comment. :) i think the pic wasn''t too sharp.</td>', 'Originally posted by booboo_goon: Are you SERIOUS??? This was my top pick from the bunch, I think there is so much to look at in this pic. The peculiar way he''s holding on to the bike is very interesting, my eyes also stops by to take a peak inside the yellow box behind him. To top it off his facial expression is one that you could never capture in a posed photograph!! Love the colours and the crop of the shot too =)   Thanx booboo_goon for ur wonderful comment. :) i think the pic wasn''t too sharp.', '2009-05-04 02:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467276, 784378, 88523, '<td valign="top">I like the emphasis on the payphone... The person is secondary and illustrates the countless people who have spoken with countless others on the other lines talking about countless different things.</td>', 'I like the emphasis on the payphone... The person is secondary and illustrates the countless people who have spoken with countless others on the other lines talking about countless different things.', '2009-05-04 06:28:30.000000', NULL, 0),
