(5498624, 784399, 67145, '<td valign="top">i reckon if there''d been a strong enough wind and his umbrella was large enough it might''v lifted him clear off the ground .!!!. bet you would''v got some brilliant shots of that .. !!.. lol .. !!..;)</td>', 'i reckon if there''d been a strong enough wind and his umbrella was large enough it might''v lifted him clear off the ground .!!!. bet you would''v got some brilliant shots of that .. !!.. lol .. !!..;)', '2009-05-24 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5504979, 784380, 67258, '<td valign="top">Its a bit of a shame that there is a bit of a lack of detail in the bowler (?not sure what they are called in baseball, so I am using cricket terminology..), but that is more than made up for by that wonderful shadow - well spotted.</td>', 'Its a bit of a shame that there is a bit of a lack of detail in the bowler (?not sure what they are called in baseball, so I am using cricket terminology..), but that is more than made up for by that wonderful shadow - well spotted.', '2009-05-29 17:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
