(5526842, 783973, 107694, '<td valign="top">Very natural photo of a special look.</td>', 'Very natural photo of a special look.', '2009-06-13 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553481, 783084, 16106, '<td valign="top">Since no one really noted this in comments, I wanted to point out that it looks like you are backfocusing. <br/> <br/>The bricks about a meter behind the guys are in focus, as is the parking meter and the fender, while the face of the fellow on the left is very soft. Try shooting down a brick wall or a measuring tape to see where your focal depth is. It could be a one time thing or an issue that will mess up a lot of good shots.</td>', 'Since no one really noted this in comments, I wanted to point out that it looks like you are backfocusing.  The bricks about a meter behind the guys are in focus, as is the parking meter and the fender, while the face of the fellow on the left is very soft. Try shooting down a brick wall or a measuring tape to see where your focal depth is. It could be a one time thing or an issue that will mess up a lot of good shots.', '2009-07-01 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5579369, 784308, 33535, '<td valign="top">not quite candid (i guess), but a great "independent" kinda fashion shot! adding to favs.</td>', 'not quite candid (i guess), but a great "independent" kinda fashion shot! adding to favs.', '2009-07-19 18:50:59.000000', NULL, 0),
